# The framework write-journal hook creates .claude/session-state/write-journal/
# at THIS directory root whenever a validator runs with its CWD resolving here.
# That is a test-time side-effect, never part of a fixture. Anchored (leading /)
# so it ignores ONLY test-fixtures/.claude -- the fixture subdirectory
# fully-instrumented/.claude/ is a deliberate, committed fixture artifact and is
# NOT matched by this rule.
/.claude/
